# Tailwind CSS v4

- Tokens defined once in `web/src/styles/globals.css` `@theme`. Consume as utilities — never hardcode hex in components.

```tsx
// ❌ hardcoded palette
<div className="bg-[#1e1e1e] text-[#bb86fc]">

// ✅ design tokens
<div className="bg-surface text-primary">
```

- Reuse primitives under `components/ui/`; avoid copy-pasted long `className` strings.
- Prefer semantic token utilities (`bg-surface`, `text-muted`, `border-outline`) over raw spacing/color one-offs.
- WCAG AA: visible focus rings, keyboard paths, `aria-*` on icon-only controls.
- Product states: `empty` · `ready` · `running` · `success` · `warning` · `error` · `disabled` · `awaiting-approval`. See `DESIGN.md`.
